{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ec4f354ed968809e272a61979d6be92d568ad936472df58d0e347bb01e18e9ec", "ja": "（そろそろ初公演が始まるのに、紗代子がいない。\nいったいどこに行ったんだ？）", "zh": "（首次公演都快开始了，纱代子却不在。\n她究竟上哪去了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "6f7d80bf78eb0c3ce83d1b27205ca8609f10eec687f42079da6e312d4b7dd927", "ja": "お、お客さん……あんなに入ってる。\n今から私も、あのステージで歌うんだ……。", "zh": "观、观众……来了那么多。\n我等一下也要在那个舞台上唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "0a8a0eb7b2a0c94ee4eb98ac0693a41787817f1961a6a40a9dadf93cf312a31b", "ja": "だ、大丈夫！　毎日、たくさん\nレッスンしてきたんだからっ。大丈夫……。", "zh": "没、没问题！毕竟我每天\n都有做很多训练，没问题的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4c8ab42f562a438539832b8d4880c5a459098a663530f4e8d956ce082c911bdd", "ja": "紗代子！\nよかった、ここにいたのか。", "zh": "纱代子！\n太好了，原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "80655cdbb1896dc2e78a21d93f45ff77d49fa4675ee3d20db7b9fc2c87ac1b7c", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？\n……あ、{$P$}……？", "zh": "呀啊！？\n……啊，{$P$}……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "021034bfb4c01839530294439c4ab198f5e2db3ffcabbe0104b30140fa8b25c1", "ja": "準備はできてるか？\nもうすぐ出番だぞ。", "zh": "你做好准备了吗？\n就快轮到你出场啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "8d70f694126b520554bdf6df2f137943197dbc091ca8b9fe1d1cdff3b32557ce", "ja": "は、はいっ。大丈夫です！\n歌詞も、ダンスの振り付けも、完璧に覚えてます！", "zh": "好、好了，没问题的！\n歌词跟舞步，我全都记得很清楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "32bdb6aca607d710934ffb8bfaa583f724e3e584ca93b34d078d030e33678b41", "ja": "全然、緊張もしてませんっ。\n……だ、だから、何も心配いりません！", "zh": "我完全不紧张……\n所、所以，用不着担心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4b38a46dfc311e386812334202c37232f4e8e89949fd4f9df213c57c1d933371", "ja": "そうだな。\n俺も、紗代子なら大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n我也觉得纱代子肯定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "07cac52b9df17726abaf1db5cb45185439e0856cc6228c48405f1f9878f9888e", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？\n本当の本当に、大丈夫だと思いますか！？", "zh": "真、真的吗！？\n你真的真的、觉得没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0df1385cc07c2ac161872fe8631c65ad55f81c172729e1be69776c676425b5a9", "ja": "ああ。今日までたくさん練習してきたことは、\n紗代子自身が一番よくわかっているはずだ。", "zh": "是呀。我想纱代子自己应该最清楚，\n至今你已做过许多练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "e1052c88df99d3dddb73d81f1aaf208904b8339f69d62492ec291d4624f1314e", "ja": "は、はい……精一杯、努力したつもりです。\nでも、他にできることがあったんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "是、是啊……我自认已经尽全力了。\n但还是会担心是不是还能更努力一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "bebd92086d41b68f3c97dae0a8d2d2e28312d4bb82d3f6667af68d5063c4f106", "ja": "私は……他のみんなより、\n何倍も努力しないと追いつけないって思うから。", "zh": "因为我觉得……自己必须比其他人\n努力好几倍，才能追上她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "239c57e4442b6c6a2c083227efe1083cdbc785627cf42ec0ec3556d61326b711", "ja": "今の私がステージに立っても、みんなの足手まといに\nなるんじゃないかって、そう思っちゃって……。", "zh": "我担心现在的自己站上舞台，\n会妨碍到其他人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "540777b02973aab633fdfdafd97f3585f2f8622ab900cb9a80ea85f9991de2dd", "ja": "失敗してもいいから、気にするな。\nだから、自信を持ってステージに上がってほしい。", "zh": "就算失败也无所谓，不用在意。\n重点是，我希望你能抱持自信站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "cd852214f82a4abf094e0a4223fa15a201d8b87d83a83137324617d65514dfdb", "ja": "し、失敗なんて、そんなのダメですよ！\nせっかくのステージが台無しになっちゃいます！", "zh": "失、失败什么的，绝对不行！\n难得的表演会被我毁掉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f0b6e299347d99b339e20b26d9310859da479517d835470aa3c04fcb3a29728f", "ja": "もし失敗したとしても、次で挽回すればいい。\n大事なのは失敗を恐れないで、全力を尽くすこと……。", "zh": "就算失败了，下次再挽回就好。\n重要的是不害怕失败，尽全力去表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ba5f7d027915d3dd86cb71380aff20c57e21c965acc70d1688970ff9d257583e", "ja": "何度もオーディションを受けて、今ここにいる\n紗代子なら、わかるんじゃないか？", "zh": "参加过多次甄选、努力走到这一步的纱代子，\n应该明白这点吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "11c6480084ce99297bcb3c475d7321d259c9a8d8a49c2daffe2577ba50de2272", "ja": "だから今日は、紗代子の努力の成果を、\nお客さんに全部見せればいい。わかったか？", "zh": "所以今天只要把纱代子努力的成果，\n全部展现给观众欣赏就好了。明白吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bdb71495256ef262bf325e6a9f67fdbc0533ea0ea17ba5e37f2714303839de3a", "ja": "お客さんは、紗代子のステージを\n楽しみに来てくれてるんだからな！", "zh": "毕竟观众是期待看纱代子的表演而来的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "269406261534e16e8f64a9ebbc4c3591cb8c48c2859d2c341d283dab822608b3", "ja": "そう……そうですよね。\nお客さんに、楽しんでもらわなくちゃ……。", "zh": "你……你说得对。\n我应该让观众们开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "665c24235041c913677f1bebd500e5c6cfa09e979ef9c249480bd289b9450cde", "ja": "当たり前のことなのに、私……\n一番大事なことを、忘れちゃってました。", "zh": "这明明是理所当然的，我……\n我却忘了最重要的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "240b77b55a22ce09572c590239df27d41b4adbfdfbe1bae357834d8dd2d7e82d", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nプロデューサーの言葉を胸に、最後まで頑張ります！", "zh": "非常感谢！\n我会把制作人说的话放在心上，努力到最后的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "df1c6eca1401032b32b0c48c05a09827a7ceef08a7a77b90f33ee3427929eb2c", "ja": "よし、行ってこい！", "zh": "很好，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_027say_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fbf553df0581dacd7f682104fb7418c20d0094c1ebdd8c1ec296b0c946e167d5", "ja": "（オーディションの時と同じ目……もう大丈夫だ。\nこのステージが、紗代子のアイドルとしての一歩だ！）", "zh": "（那个眼神跟甄选时一模一样……不用再替她担心了。\n这场表演，就是纱代子以偶像身分踏出的第一步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
